 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.65","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.65/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"3c4e7b34883ccaf0bac4a5240500c292c3acef1add5876ab5afb48198b429faa"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.65/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"cfa8c276a658ed9b68cfd486921c14e430749e1a09a2376bd3c97649f4aec2b7"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.65/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"7798876de95e524b90f64edabb98e976957d838cf165d57e3b5b414819226324"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.65/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"1da5212f56a2c4102b320de1866b7d046b78dd4be823f2458fb946f58a98f4cc"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.65"}